// input: after idr-simplify
// ack's m counts down from 3: calls of ack are calls of a clone for one m.
// The generic function stays. countUp's counter starts too far up to
// unroll. `count 3` is a call of the clone that runs the action it returns,
// with the world.
// CHECK-DAG: call @Main.ack.spec{{[0-9]+}}(%{{.*}}){{.*}}: (i64) -> i64
// CHECK-DAG: idr.func private @Main.ack(
// CHECK-DAG: call @Main.countUp(
// CHECK-DAG: call @Main.count.raise{{[0-9]+}}(%{{.*}}, %{{.*}}){{.*}}: (i64, !idr.world)
